    {
      question: "Can I customize gaming clan banners with our team name or clan tag?",
      answer: "Yes! Click the 'Customize' button on any preset card to launch the built-in Asset Customizer Studio. You can type your clan tag or server name into the Custom Text Overlay tool, choose neon drop-glow styling, tweak hue and contrast, and download the finished asset instantly."
